        "raw": "<p>Just finished a game against Voss with the heroes near full strength.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>GI Bunker started with Ammo Drop</p><p>Young Legacy started with Inspiring Prescence</p><p>Mr. Fixer started with Dual Crowbars</p><p>Ra played Imbued Fire</p><p>Absolute Zero neutered a Forced Deployment with Fueled Freeze</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Neither ship came out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Realm of Discord had little negative effect. Positive Energy didn&#39;t help the minions enough to keep them alive. Time Crawls only slowed me down a little. Ethereal Bubbles got one-shot by the second hit from Dual Crowbars. Time Flies was fun.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bunker had a hand full of cards but never got to take advantage of Gatling Gun or Omnicannon because of Time Crawls. Both of them got played when Time Flies came out, but I won the game a couple hero turns later. Bunker&#39;s removal of Voss&#39; DR meant I could leave one minion out and just pound Voss on his front side. I actually had to leave two minions out so that Mr. Fixer would have a first target with his Dual Crowbars so he could hit Voss as the second target.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imbued Fire meant Absolute Zero couldn&#39;t heal himself after the first round, making Thermal Shockwave less useful, but two Impaling Structures were quite nice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
